Asikyira reached the final with a hard-fought 1–0 victory over Sanrobonia. The match was a tactical battle, with both teams canceling each other out for long stretches. The breakthrough came in the 67th minute when [[Youssef Al-Hassan]] rose highest to meet a corner kick, powering a header past the Sanrobonian goalkeeper. Sanrobonia pushed for an equalizer but found the Asikyira defense impenetrable, and the match ended with Asikyira advancing to face Balisca in the final.

